                "description": "The Ellington Handleset with Walker Knob is a transitional entry set poised on the edge of modern silhouette and traditional elegance. This single cylinder door lock comes packaged as a complete set with the beautiful Walker Half-Round Knob. The Transitional Ellington Entry Door Handleset with Walker Knob will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
